      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone who performs in VRChat regularly I'd love to be able to attach a tracker to my guitar, and have this in combination with a better hand-tracking system than what we currently have (e.g. https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-a-hand-tracker-to-the-osc-tracker)",
